WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Supernatural Crowley got something of an

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.110
intervention and Dean finally got his hands
on the First Blade.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:13.660
Alaina Huffman was absent, but she left a
very notable calling card on the baby.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:17.900
Seriously, I couldn’t tell if Dean was more
upset by that or about the First Blade.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.930
Quick heads up too, next week’s episode,
“Mother’s Little Helper” is directed

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:22.930
by Misha Collins.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:23.930
I’m back on my normal schedule.

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.760
So be sure to subscribe to get my video for
that.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.760
I’ll post it Wednesday Morning.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.940
So about half of this episode was Leaving
Las Vegas and Half National Treasure.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.481
So I’m going to do my top 5 moments and
then my review.

00:00:33.481 --> 00:00:34.481
It’s kind of a mixture of visual gags and
action.

00:00:34.481 --> 00:00:36.059
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
the episode.

00:00:36.059 --> 00:00:37.059
Here we go.

00:00:37.059 --> 00:00:41.030
Number 5 - Crowley’s Sex, Pizza and Human
Blood bender.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:45.250
If you’ve never seen Leaving Las Vegas it’s
a movie where Nicolas Cage decides to slowly

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:50.309
drink himself to death over a weekend in Vegas
and hires Elisabeth Shue, a hooker.

00:00:50.309 --> 00:00:51.780
To hang out with him while he does it.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.969
That movie is a really intense drama, but
it was all I could think about during this

00:00:56.969 --> 00:00:57.969
in between laughs.

00:00:57.969 --> 00:01:02.289
It really is like he’s just an aging rockstar
heroin junkie.

00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:04.339
Number 4 - Crowley’s Intervention.

00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:06.570
I loved Dean barking in Crowley’s face.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.520
Like he was going to yell him sober.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.390
It also reminded me of the Dog Dean episode.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:15.350
I feel like I missed the addictive aspect
of blood in the previous episodes.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:18.990
I always knew he enjoyed it, but I didn’t
know that human blood had the same side effects

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.160
as a human taking intraveous drugs.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:26.009
The way Crowley played it up, it made it seem
like Human blood, for him, was like heroin

00:01:26.009 --> 00:01:29.439
laced acid with some cocaine sprinkled on
top.

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:31.630
Just to make it extra addictive.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.979
Number 3 - Snooki at the Crossroads

00:01:33.979 --> 00:01:38.420
I hate Snooki, but I will confess that this
was funny.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.700
Especially the implication first that she
was only famous because she was getting fringe

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:47.420
benefits from working for Crowley and two,
that before they left, they exorcised the

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.350
demon inside her.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:52.780
Teasing that Snooki wouldn’t be famous anymore
now that there wasn’t a demon possessing

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:53.780
her.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:58.000
I’m all for the Winchesters performing a
Snooki exorcism on all our televisions.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.270
Just make her go away.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.270
Forever.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.590
Number 2 - First Blade National Treasure

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:06.670
This was everything up to the point of Deputy
Andy from Eureka going all creepy.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:11.310
I loved the Men of Letters lore and the Mad
Science spell aspect of this.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.069
Way more interesting than the Crowley as Junkie
story.

00:02:14.069 --> 00:02:18.700
When he said he had a Zoo in his pocket dimension
house, I instantly thought of The Island of

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.180
Doctor Moreau.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:24.810
Part of me is wondering now if he was using
spells to try and mess with Demon DNA.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.180
Although, if they’re ethereal beings, maybe
they don’t have DNA?

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:31.040
Deep Monster Thoughts.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.500
You could have done an entire episode inside
his house though.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.780
Just think of all the powerful relics he had
collected.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.690
It’s like Sam and Dean should combine all
the knowledge and spells from the Men of Letters

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.819
Bunker with all the weapons from Cuthbert’s
collection.

00:02:43.819 --> 00:02:48.120
They’d have everything they need to fight
a war against rogue Angels and Abaddon’s

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.120
demons.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:55.489
Although I guess all you really need is Dean
and the First Blade.

00:02:55.489 --> 00:02:58.270
and my number one Moment - Dean Activates
the First Blade

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:03.260
They’ve kept on teasing us with this “price”
that you have to pay to wield the blade.

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:07.260
And based on Dean’s reaction to it, I think
we can assume that it just puts you into a

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:12.319
killing frenzy where you just tune out mentally
and can’t distinguish friend from foe.

00:03:12.319 --> 00:03:17.360
Meaning, Dean could potentially end up killing
Castiel accidentally if he’s around when

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.970
Dean tries to kill Abaddon.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:22.220
Or he could accidentally kill Sam.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:26.069
Based on the teaser for the next episode,
it seems like their brotherly tension is reaching

00:03:26.069 --> 00:03:27.069
boiling point.

00:03:27.069 --> 00:03:29.819
Now it’s your turn though.

00:03:29.819 --> 00:03:34.019
Let me know what your favorite moment was
and do you think that the Blade is going to

00:03:34.019 --> 00:03:37.120
make Dean accidentally kill Sam or Castiel?

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.020
If you didn’t catch it, there were two Stargate
Atlantis and Eureka Cameos.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.920
This is filmed in Vancouver, so actors are
bound to show up on shows together all the

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:43.920
time.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:53.690
Sheriff Andy, was Major Lorne and Dean Marshall
was Sargeant Bradley on Stargate and he was

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.439
also Doctor Herrerra on Eureka.

00:03:55.439 --> 00:03:57.040
I love Vancouver shows.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.650
This happens a lot with Battlestar Galactica
actors too.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:05.980
Overall I gave the episode a B, just because
I really was not digging the Crowley Junkie

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:06.980
Plot.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:10.330
I’m really just referring to the resolution.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:14.590
I love the idea that he’s addicted to Human
Blood.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:17.239
But I felt like we didn’t need fifty percent
of this episode.

00:04:17.239 --> 00:04:22.680
They could have just spent the entire time
in this amazing National Treasure-esque house.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.830
There were just way too many teasers for magical
items we did not get to see.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.630
It would be like Harry Potter if they never
explored Hogwarts.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.860
Just a criminal misuse of a magical museum.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:36.250
I did love everything to do with the First
Blade.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.930
Especially those music cues that swelled when
Dean picked it up.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:44.360
I wonder if that plot will mirror the Human
Blood Crowley plot.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:47.770
And Dean will get addicted to the emotions
the Blade gives him.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:51.610
I feel like they were implying that it gives
the bearer equal feelings of invincibility

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.280
and murderous rage.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.610
Just like drugs.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:58.600
Although Crowley’s drugs seemed more euphoric.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:07.900
Next week Alaina Huffman is back, which makes
me happy.

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.510
Abbadon is cool, but I love Alaina Huffman.

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:13.990
Let me know what you thought of the episode
and if you thought of Sheriff Andy when you

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:14.990
saw Cuthbert.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.990
I’ll try to post next week’s Supernatural
by Wednesday Morning.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.020
My schedule is slowly getting back to normal.

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:24.060
Right now click here for my last supernatural
episode and click here to learn about my top

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:26.750
10 Doctor Who Monsters for Series 8.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.710
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.270
High Fives!

